{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05125","headline":"入鬼门关 · 沈佺期","name":"入鬼门关","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔传瘴江路，今到鬼门关。\n土地无人老，流移几客还。\n自从别京洛，颓鬓与衰颜。\n夕宿含沙里，晨行冈路间。\n马危千仞谷，舟险万重湾。\n问我投何地？西南尽百蛮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05125.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05125","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}